  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with no aggregation, isolating the effect of aggregation in RNA-only settings. Validation accuracy (0.520) and F1 (0.498) are lower than the prior aggregation-based baseline (config_006: 0.653 accuracy), suggesting aggregation may improve performance. However, the exact impact of aggregation and its interaction with other design choices remain uncertain without direct comparison to alternative aggregation methods."
